Limits

Modules with no assignment: a module with no assignment in the schedule is not rewritten.
Modules with no cell: a module that has assignments but no cell in the old sheet is only reported, because its name and colour are unknown.
Whole days only: hours are not written to the sheet.
Empty style: an emptied cell gets the common empty style (style 4 in this file), so a blank cell that was coloured before is not restored.
